    {
      "text": "%md\nFrom the previous cell we can see the dataset contains 109.Obviously not all of them will be feasible for our system recommandation.\nAs a consequence we need to drop uncesseary features.\n- Note : Some features could not help for recommandations but they will useful for filtering and features engineering in order to load a credible and meaningful data for our model \n\nBased on the informations described in the open food facts details page [Link Here](https://wiki.openfoodfacts.org/Data_fields),\nand other sites and also personnal observations the following list of columns will be dropped .",
      "user": "anonymous",
