          {
            "type": "HTML",
            "data": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"markdown-body\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFrom the previous cell we can see the dataset contains 109.Obviously not all of them will be feasible for our system recommandation.\u003cbr /\u003e\nAs a consequence we need to drop uncesseary features.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNote : Some features could not help for recommandations but they will useful for filtering and features engineering in order to load a credible and meaningful data for our model\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBased on the informations described in the open food facts details page \u003ca href\u003d\"https://wiki.openfoodfacts.org/Data_fields\"\u003eLink Here\u003c/a\u003e,\u003cbr /\u003e\nand other sites and also personnal observations the following list of columns will be dropped .\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e"
          }
